---
import { sourceUrl } from '../data/labels.ts';
---
<figure class="architecture">
  <p class="visually-hidden">
    The CLI and its Ink renderer call the application service, which owns state in a domain SQLite database with
    immutable source snapshots and writes each new Markdown plan and decision memo. Separately, the doctor command
    runs a LangGraph probe against the official SQLite checkpointer.
  </p>
  <div class="arch" aria-hidden="true">
    <span class="node">CLI · Ink</span>
    <span class="arrow">→</span>
    <span class="node node--core">Application service<small>owns state</small></span>
    <span class="arrow">→</span>
    <span class="node">Domain SQLite<small>+ immutable snapshots</small></span>
    <span class="branch">↳</span>
    <span class="node node--output">New Markdown plan + decision memo</span>
    <span class="node node--probe">doctor</span>
    <span class="arrow arrow--probe">→</span>
    <span class="node node--probe">Separate LangGraph probe</span>
    <span class="arrow arrow--probe">→</span>
    <span class="node node--probe">Official SQLite checkpointer</span>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    The terminal renders results; the application service owns state.{' '}
    <a href={sourceUrl('docs/architecture.md')} rel="noopener">Architecture and tradeoffs</a>{' · '}
    <a href={sourceUrl('docs/plan-01-acceptance.md')} rel="noopener">Acceptance evidence</a>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .architecture {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-3);
    margin-top: var(--space-6);
  }

  figcaption {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: var(--step--1);
  }

  figcaption a {
    color: var(--accent);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .arch {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) auto minmax(0, 1.2fr) auto minmax(0, 1.2fr);
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--space-3) var(--space-4);
    padding: var(--space-6);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: var(--radius-l);
    background: var(--term-bg);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
  }

  .node {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-1);
    padding: var(--space-3) var(--space-4);
    border: 1px solid rgb(120 147 141 / 0.45);
    border-radius: var(--radius-s);
    background: #142230;
    color: var(--term-text);
    text-align: center;
  }

  .node small {
    color: var(--term-dim);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
  }

  .node--core {
    border-color: #d8eeae;
  }

  .arrow,
  .branch {
    color: var(--term-dim);
    font-size: 1.15rem;
  }

  .branch {
    grid-column: 3;
    justify-self: center;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .node--output {
    grid-column: 3 / span 3;
    justify-self: start;
    border-style: dashed;
  }

  .node--probe {
    margin-top: var(--space-4);
    background: transparent;
    color: var(--term-dim);
  }

  .arrow--probe {
    margin-top: var(--space-4);
  }

  @media (max-width: 44rem) {
    .arch {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
      justify-items: stretch;
    }

    .arch .arrow,
    .arch .branch {
      justify-self: center;
      rotate: 90deg;
    }

    .branch,
    .node--output {
      grid-column: auto;
      justify-self: stretch;
    }

    .branch {
      rotate: 0deg;
    }
  }
</style>
